#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:4
msgid "Applying Effects"
msgstr "应用特效"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:5
msgid "Effects can be applied to animation levels, images and clips exposed in Xsheet columns (or Timeline layers) in the **FX Schematic**, where each element is represented as a node."
msgstr "特效可以应用到在**特效示意图**中显示的动画层、图像和剪辑上（通过Xsheet列或时间轴图层），其中每个元素都表示为一个节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:7
msgid "The relationship between the contents of columns/layers and effects can be managed by connecting or disconnecting links between nodes."
msgstr "列/图层内容与特效之间的关系可以通过连接或断开节点之间的链接来管理。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:9
msgid "|dwanko_before_fx| |dwanko_after_fx|"
msgstr "|dwanko_before_fx| |dwanko_after_fx|"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:15
msgid "Using the FX Schematic"
msgstr "使用特效示意图"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:16
msgid "In the FX schematic all columns/layers are displayed as nodes having an output port connected to the Xsheet node: this means that their content is part of the scene and is rendered as it is."
msgstr "在特效示意图中，所有列/图层都显示为节点，其输出端口连接到Xsheet节点：这意味着它们的内容是场景的一部分，并按原样渲染。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:18
msgid "When effects are added, they are displayed as nodes as well, with ports to create links that let you set the way the effect modify the scene contents."
msgstr "当添加特效时，它们也显示为节点，带有用于创建链接的端口，这些链接让你可以设置特效修改场景内容的方式。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:20
msgid ""
"Column/layer nodes have the **Camera Stand** (|camera_stand|) and the **Render** (|preview|) toggles on the top right: these toggles are the same as the toggles available in the Xsheet column (or "
"Timeline layer) headers (see :ref:`Working with Xsheet Columns <working_with_xsheet_columns>`  ). Effects nodes only have the **Render** toggle (|preview|) allowing you to include or exclude "
"temporarily the effect in the rendering."
msgstr ""
"列/图层节点右上角有**拍摄台** (|camera_stand|) 和**渲染** (|preview|) 切换按钮：这些切换按钮与Xsheet列（或时间轴图层）标题中的切换按钮相同（参见 :ref:`处理Xsheet列 <working_with_xsheet_columns>`）。特"
"效节点只有**渲染**切换按钮 (|preview|)，允许你临时在渲染中包含或排除该特效。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:22
msgid "Nodes can be easily selected and arranged. When selected, nodes are highlighted in *white*; the *current* node has its label in *yellow*."
msgstr "节点可以轻松选择和排列。选中时，节点以*白色*高亮显示；*当前*节点的标签显示为*黄色*。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:24
msgid "**To access the FX Schematic:**"
msgstr "**要访问特效示意图：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:26
msgid "Click the Schematic toggle button (|schematic|) at the right of the bottom bar of the Schematic window until the title bar displays **FX Schematic**."
msgstr "点击示意图窗口底部栏右侧的示意图切换按钮 (|schematic|)，直到标题栏显示**特效示意图**。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:28
msgid "**To navigate the FX Schematic:**"
msgstr "**要在特效示意图中导航：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:30 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:50 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:58 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:85
#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:144 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:152 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:164 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:174
#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:184 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:227 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:245 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:253
#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:269 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:314 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:322 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:338
#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:384 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:396 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:406 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:424
#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:464 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:506 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:602
msgid "Do one of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:32 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:466
msgid "Use the mouse wheel, or the zoom shortcut keys (by default **+** and **-** keys) to zoom in and zoom out."
msgstr "使用鼠标滚轮或缩放快捷键（默认是 **+** 和 **-** 键）进行放大和缩小。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:34 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:468
msgid "Middle-click and drag to scroll in any direction."
msgstr "中键点击并拖动可在任意方向滚动。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:36
msgid "Use the **Fit to Window** button (|fit_to_window|) in the bottom bar of the Schematic window to display all of the nodes in the current window."
msgstr "使用示意图窗口底部栏中的**适应窗口**按钮 (|fit_to_window|) 可在当前窗口中显示所有节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:38
msgid "Use the **Focus on Current** button (|focus_on_current|) in the bottom bar of the Schematic window to center the Schematic on the current node."
msgstr "使用示意图窗口底部栏中的**聚焦当前**按钮 (|focus_on_current|) 可将示意图视图居中于当前节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:40
msgid "Use the **Reorder Nodes** button (|reorder_nodes|) in the bottom bar of the Schematic window to reorder all the nodes."
msgstr "使用示意图窗口底部栏中的**重排节点**按钮 (|reorder_nodes|) 可重新排列所有节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:42
msgid ""
"Use the **Reset Size** button (|reset|) in the bottom bar of the Schematic window, or use the **Reset View** shortcut (by default the **Alt + 0** key) to display all of the nodes at the default size."
msgstr "使用示意图窗口底部栏中的**重置大小**按钮 (|reset|)，或使用**重置视图**快捷键（默认是 **Alt + 0** 键），可按默认大小显示所有节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:44 ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:190
msgid "**To rename a node:**"
msgstr "**要重命名节点：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:46
msgid "Ctrl + double-click the node name and type a new name."
msgstr "Ctrl + 双击节点名称，然后输入新名称。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:48
msgid "**To minimize or maximize the column/layer and effect nodes:**"
msgstr "**要最小化或最大化列/图层和特效节点：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:52
msgid "Click the arrowhead to the left of the node name to minimize/maximize columns selectively."
msgstr "点击节点名称左侧的箭头可选择性最小化/最大化列。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:54
msgid "Click the **Minimize/Maximize** (|minimize|/|maximize|) button in the bottom bar of the Schematic window to minimize/maximize all the column nodes."
msgstr "点击示意图窗口底部栏中的**最小化/最大化**按钮 (|minimize|/|maximize|) 可最小化/最大化所有列节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:56
msgid "**To select nodes:**"
msgstr "**要选择节点：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:60
msgid "Click to select a node."
msgstr "点击选择一个节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:62
msgid "Click and drag to select a group of nodes."
msgstr "点击并拖拽以选择一组节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:64
msgid "Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (macOS) to add a node to, or remove it from the selection."
msgstr "Ctrl-点击（PC）或 Cmd-点击（macOS）可将节点添加到选区或从选区中移除。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:66
msgid "*Links* can be selected together with nodes (see  :ref:`Editing the FX Schematic <editing_the_fx_schematic>`  )."
msgstr "*链接*可以与节点一起选择（参见 :ref:`编辑特效示意图 <editing_the_fx_schematic>`）。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:68
msgid "**To move the selection:**"
msgstr "**要移动选区：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:70
msgid "Click and drag any node of the selection."
msgstr "点击并拖拽选区中的任意节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:72
msgid "**To include or exclude temporally an effect from the rendering:**"
msgstr "**要临时在渲染中包含或排除一个特效：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:74
msgid "Click the **Render** toggle (|preview|) on the upper right corner of the effect node."
msgstr "点击特效节点右上角的**渲染**切换按钮 (|preview|)。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:80
msgid "Grouping Nodes"
msgstr "节点编组"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:81
msgid ""
"It's possible to group several nodes into one single node, in order to better manage the whole FX Schematic. Groups can be opened to be examined and edited, and its components can be selected for "
"further operations, like editing effect settings, or creating new groups."
msgstr "可以将多个节点编组为一个单独的节点，以便更好地管理整个特效示意图。可以打开组进行检查和编辑，也可以选择其组件进行进一步操作，如编辑特效设置或创建新组。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:83
msgid "**To Group selected nodes:**"
msgstr "**要将选中的节点编组：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:87
msgid "Right-click any selected node and choose **Group** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键点击任意选中的节点，从弹出的菜单中选择**编组**。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:89
msgid "Press the **Ctrl-G** (PC) or **Cmd-G** (macOS) shortcut."
msgstr "按下 **Ctrl-G**（PC）或 **Cmd-G**（macOS）快捷键。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:91
msgid "**To open a Group:**"
msgstr "**要打开一个组：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:93
msgid "Right-click the group and choose **Open Group** from the menu that opens: the group nodes are displayed in a box, showing links between group nodes, and links with nodes outside of the group."
msgstr "右键点击组，从弹出的菜单中选择**打开组**：组节点显示在一个框内，展示组节点之间的链接以及与组外节点的链接。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:95
msgid "In the FX Schematic, when the content of a group is displayed, it's possible to edit the links between Group nodes and links with nodes outside of the group."
msgstr "在特效示意图中，当组的内容显示时，可以编辑组内节点之间以及与组外节点的链接。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:97
msgid "**To close a Group:**"
msgstr "**要关闭一个组：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:99
msgid "Click the **Close** button on the right of the group box title bar."
msgstr "点击组框标题栏右侧的**关闭**按钮。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:101
msgid "**To release a Group:**"
msgstr "**要释放一个组（取消编组）：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:103
msgid "Right-click the Group and choose **Ungroup** from the menu that opens, or press the shortcut **Ctrl-Shift-G** (PC) or **Cmd-Shift-G** (macOS)."
msgstr "右键点击组，从弹出的菜单中选择**取消编组**，或按下快捷键 **Ctrl-Shift-G**（PC）或 **Cmd-Shift-G**（macOS）。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:109
msgid "Inserting Effects"
msgstr "插入特效"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:110
msgid ""
"You can **Insert** effects to selected nodes, **Add** effects to the Schematic, or **Replace** previously added effect nodes. This can be done from the **FX Browser** window or by using the drop-down "
"menu that opens when right-clicking nodes or an empty area of the FX Schematic. Both are organized in folders/submenus containing sets of effects; if some *Presets* are defined for an effect, an "
"additional folder/submenu is available (see  :ref:`Creating Presets <creating_presets>`  )."
msgstr ""
"你可以向选定的节点**插入**特效、向示意图**添加**特效或**替换**先前添加的特效节点。这可以通过**特效浏览器**窗口，或通过右键点击节点或特效示意图空白区域时弹出的下拉菜单来完成。两者都按包含特效集的文件"
"夹/子菜单进行组织；如果为某个特效定义了一些*预设*，则会有一个额外的文件夹/子菜单可用（参见 :ref:`创建预设 <creating_presets>`）。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:112
msgid "|FX_Browser|"
msgstr "|FX_Browser|"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:114
msgid ""
"When *inserting* effects, they will be placed along the link that starts from the selected node output port; when *adding* effects, they will be placed at the end of a new link that will start from "
"the selected node output port."
msgstr "*插入*特效时，它们将放置在从选定节点输出端口开始的链接上；*添加*特效时，它们将放置在从选定节点输出端口开始的新链接的末端。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:116
msgid ""
"In case several nodes are selected, the effect will be added/inserted for *each* selected node, but all the added/inserted effects will be *Linked*, and connected visually by a *green* line. This "
"means that every time the effect is edited, all the linked nodes will be edited as well, unless you break the link to start editing them separately."
msgstr ""
"如果选中了多个节点，特效将被添加/插入到*每个*选定的节点，但所有添加/插入的特效将是*链接的*，并通过一条*绿色*线视觉连接。这意味着每次编辑该特效时，所有链接的节点也会被编辑，除非你断开链接以开始单独编辑"
"它们。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:118
msgid "To globally apply effects it's possible to use the **Xsheet** node as if it were a standard column node (representing the whole content of the scene) and inserting effects from there."
msgstr "要全局应用特效，可以使用**Xsheet**节点，就像它是一个标准列节点（代表场景的整个内容）一样，并从此处插入特效。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:120
msgid "Three different types of effects can be used in the Schematic, each with a different type of node:"
msgstr "示意图中可以使用三种不同类型的特效，每种对应不同类型的节点："

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Basic effects**, such as the Blur effect, that simply modify the contents of a column; they are displayed as a yellow node with an input port on the left, labelled *Source*, and an output port on "
"the right."
msgstr "**基础特效**，例如模糊特效，仅修改列的内容；它们显示为一个黄色的节点，左侧有一个输入端口，标记为*源*，右侧有一个输出端口。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:124
msgid "|Basic_FX_Example|"
msgstr "|Basic_FX_Example|"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:126
msgid ""
"To affect a column/layer, they have to be inserted in the link from the column/layer node to the Xsheet node, so that the column/layer node is connected to the effect input port, and the effect node "
"output port is connected to the Xsheet node."
msgstr "要影响列/图层，必须将它们插入到从列/图层节点到Xsheet节点的链接中，这样列/图层节点就连接到特效的输入端口，而特效节点的输出端口则连接到Xsheet节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:128
msgid "If several effects are applied in a chain, they will be applied one after the other, following the order from the column/layer node to the Xsheet node."
msgstr "如果多个特效以链式应用，它们将按照从列/图层节点到Xsheet节点的顺序依次应用。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:130
msgid ""
"**Combined effects**, such as the Matte In effect, that modify the column/layer contents according to the contents other columns/layers; they are displayed with a yellow node with two or more input "
"ports on the left, and one output port on the right."
msgstr "**组合特效**，例如遮罩内效果，根据其他列/图层的内容来修改列/图层的内容；它们显示为一个黄色的节点，左侧有两个或更多输入端口，右侧有一个输出端口。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:132
msgid ""
"To affect a column/layer, they have to be inserted into the link from the column/layer node to the Xsheet node, so that the column/layer node is connected to the first effect input port labelled "
"*Source*, while the other columns/layers are connected to the other input ports, whose labels depend on the effect; the effect node output port has to be connected to the Xsheet node."
msgstr ""
"要影响列/图层，必须将它们插入到从列/图层节点到Xsheet节点的链接中，这样列/图层节点就连接到标记为*源*的第一个特效输入端口，而其他列/图层则连接到其他输入端口（其标签取决于特效）；特效节点的输出端口必须连"
"接到Xsheet节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:134
msgid "|Combined_FX_Example|"
msgstr "|Combined_FX_Example|"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:136
msgid ""
"For example in case of a Matte In effect, the column to be matted has to be linked to the *Source* input port, the matte column has to be linked to the *Matte* input port, and the output port has to "
"be connected to the Xsheet node."
msgstr "例如，对于遮罩内效果，要被遮罩的列必须链接到*源*输入端口，遮罩列必须链接到*遮罩*输入端口，输出端口必须连接到Xsheet节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:138
msgid ""
"**Effects that create computer generated images**, such as the Radial Gradient, that are exposed in Xsheet columns (and Timeline layers) and therefore are similar to columns; they are displayed with "
"an orange node with only an output port on the right. These effect nodes have to be connected to the Xsheet node to be rendered, or can be connected to other effect nodes."
msgstr ""
"**生成计算机图像的特效**，例如径向渐变，它们显示在Xsheet列（和时间轴图层）中，因此类似于列；它们显示为一个橙色的节点，仅在右侧有一个输出端口。这些特效节点必须连接到Xsheet节点才能被渲染，或者可以连接到"
"其他特效节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:140
msgid "|Generated_FX_Example|"
msgstr "|Generated_FX_Example|"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:142
msgid "**To open the FX Browser:**"
msgstr "**要打开特效浏览器：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:146
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **New FX...**"
msgstr "选择 Xsheet → **新建特效...**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:148
msgid "Click the **New FX** button (|fx|) in the bottom bar of the FX Schematic window."
msgstr "点击特效示意图窗口底部栏中的**新建特效**按钮 (|fx|)。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:150
msgid "**To Insert an effect:**"
msgstr "**要插入特效：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:154
msgid "Select the nodes for which you want to insert a new effect, select the effect you want to insert in the **FX Browser** and click the **Insert** button."
msgstr "选择你想要为其插入新特效的节点，在**特效浏览器**中选择你想要插入的特效，然后点击**插入**按钮。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:156
msgid ""
"Select the nodes for which you want to insert a new effect, right-click any of them and choose **Insert FX** from the menu that opens, then select the effect you want to insert from the available "
"submenus."
msgstr "选择你想要为其插入新特效的节点，右键点击其中任意一个，从弹出的菜单中选择**插入特效**，然后从可用的子菜单中选择你想要插入的特效。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:158
msgid ""
"Select the *links* where you want to insert a new effect, right-click any of them and choose **Insert FX** from the menu that opens, then select the effect you want to insert from the available "
"submenus (see  :ref:`Editing the FX Schematic <editing_the_fx_schematic>`  )."
msgstr "选择你想要插入新特效的*链接*，右键点击其中任意一个，从弹出的菜单中选择**插入特效**，然后从可用的子菜单中选择你想要插入的特效（参见 :ref:`编辑特效示意图 <editing_the_fx_schematic>`）。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:160
msgid "**To Add an effect:**"
msgstr "**要添加特效：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:162
msgid "Select the nodes for which you want to add a new effect at the end of a new link."
msgstr "选择你想要在其新链接末端添加新特效的节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:166
msgid "Select the effect you want to add in the **FX Browser** and click the **Add** button."
msgstr "在**特效浏览器**中选择你想要添加的特效，然后点击**添加**按钮。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:168
msgid "Right-click any of the selected nodes and choose **Add FX** from the menu that opens, then select the effect you want to add from the available submenus."
msgstr "右键点击任意选中的节点，从弹出的菜单中选择**添加特效**，然后从可用的子菜单中选择你想要添加的特效。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:170
msgid "**To Replace an effect:**"
msgstr "**要替换特效：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:172
msgid "Select the effect nodes you want to replace with a new effect."
msgstr "选择你想要用新特效替换的特效节点。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:176
