#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:198
msgid "Editing the FX Schematic"
msgstr "编辑特效示意图"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:199
msgid ""
"Links between nodes have to be considered like flows going to the right, from the column/layer nodes to the *Output* node, via the Xsheet node. If along the way there is one or several effects, the "
"column content will be consequently processed before becoming part of the output."
msgstr "节点之间的链接应被视为向右流动，从列/图层节点经过Xsheet节点流向*输出*节点。如果沿途有一个或多个特效，列内容将在成为输出的一部分之前被相应地处理。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:201
msgid ""
"From the nodes output port several links can start at the same time, thus allowing, for example, a column/layer to be rendered as it is, and to be also used as a mask for another column/layer. It is "
"also possible to determine permanently whether columns/layers will be rendered or not, by leaving or deleting the link to the Xsheet node."
msgstr "从节点的输出端口可以同时发出多个链接，例如，允许一个列/图层按原样渲染，同时也用作另一个列/图层的遮罩。还可以通过保留或删除到Xsheet节点的链接，来永久决定列/图层是否被渲染。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:203
msgid "By editing the links between nodes, or by creating new ones, you can control how column/layer nodes will interact with each other and with effects before being rendered."
msgstr "通过编辑节点之间的链接，或创建新的链接，你可以控制列/图层节点在渲染前如何相互交互以及如何与特效交互。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:205
msgid "In the effects that accept multiple input nodes it is possible to change the stacking order of the input nodes by clicking and dragging in the *ports* area."
msgstr "在支持多个输入节点的特效中，可以通过在*端口*区域点击并拖动来更改输入节点的堆叠顺序。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:207
msgid ""
"Effect nodes and links can be selected in order to be cut, copied, pasted or deleted. When selected, nodes and links are highlighted in white; the current node has its label in yellow; when at least "
"one object is selected, the related links are displayed in blue."
msgstr "可以选择特效节点和链接以便剪切、复制、粘贴或删除。选中时，节点和链接以白色高亮显示；当前节点的标签为黄色；当至少一个对象被选中时，相关链接显示为蓝色。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:209
msgid "When pasting a copied/cut selection, several options are available:"
msgstr "粘贴复制/剪切的选区时，有几个选项可用："

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:211
msgid "Use **Paste** to paste the copied/cut selection into the FX Schematic."
msgstr "使用**粘贴**将复制/剪切的选区粘贴到特效示意图中。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:213
msgid "Use **Paste Insert** to insert the pasted selection into the *selected links*."
msgstr "使用**粘贴插入**将粘贴的选区插入到*选定的链接*中。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:215
msgid "Use **Paste Add** to add the pasted selection from the *selected nodes* at the end of new links."
msgstr "使用**粘贴添加**将粘贴的选区从*选定的节点*在新链接的末端添加。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:217
msgid "Use **Paste Replace** to replace *selected effects nodes* with the pasted selection."
msgstr "使用**粘贴替换**用粘贴的选区替换*选定的特效节点*。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:219
msgid "Links have to be selected together with nodes when copying/cutting a selection if you want to preserve the links among them when pasting."
msgstr "如果希望在粘贴时保留节点间的链接关系，在复制/剪切选区时，必须同时选中节点和链接。"

