msgstr "右键点击任意选中的链接，从弹出的菜单中选择**删除**。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:243
msgid "**To connect a node to the Xsheet node:**"
msgstr "**要将节点连接到Xsheet节点：**"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:247
msgid "Click and drag the output port of the node to the input port of the **Xsheet** node."
msgstr "点击并拖动节点的输出端口到**Xsheet**节点的输入端口。"

#: ../../source/applying_special_fx.rst:249
